      "statement": "Key design decisions: Bookmark is a plain @dataclass (not Pydantic) with the API wrapping it in Pydantic BookmarkIn/BookmarkOut; JSON file as database; tags are lowercased+stripped at statistics time (not storage time) so mixed-case variants are stored verbatim; import dedup merges by normalized URL with existing-wins (no overwrite).",
